# The source distribution holds the package and its metadata. Everything else in the repository (documentation,
# tutorials, validation data, examples, tools, tests) stays on GitHub: with it the archive would come close to PyPI's
# size limit of 100 MB per file (the free-atom table inside the package is 78 MB).
prune docs
prune tutorials
prune data
prune examples
prune tools
prune fortran
prune tests
prune .github
exclude .gitignore .gitattributes .readthedocs.yaml AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md
